;"ENCOUNTER"系イベント（エクストラ構文）
;※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※
@M_KOJO_ENCOUNTER_K73
;初対面、挨拶のタイミング
;TALENTの変更はここでどうぞ。
;メインマップが人里
IF MAIN_MAP == 2
	PRINTFORML 「...Right, you must be one of my new neighbors.」
	PRINTFORMW A girl in a bright crimson cape watches you, her gaze indifferent.
	PRINTFORML 「%CALLNAME:MASTER%, was it? Hmmm... I'm Sekibanki. But you don't really need to bother remembering me.」
	PRINTFORML 「I know we both relate to the misery of living in such a dilapidated tenement, but that's where our similarities end.」
	PRINTFORMW 「I won't pretend to be your senior and I won't patronize you, so don't come clinging to me crying over every little thing either.」
	;or rather, "getting too close with you", implying distance, but that felt a bit too hostile so I went with literal translation (cringe)
	PRINTFORML %BREAKENG(@"The girl who clearly expressed her disapproval of the idea of familiarity was about to abruptly part ways when she suddenly stopped dead in her tracks.")%
	PRINTFORMW 「Ah yes, and one more thing.」
	PRINTFORML You spot a mischievous smile creeping across her face for some reason, flashing from behind her upturned collar.
	PRINTFORML 「...Since we're neighbors and all, allow me to give you a fair warning, given that you're an Outsider.」
	PRINTFORML 「If you ever feel like taking a late-night stroll in this Village, watch yourself as you walk under the willow trees. Got it?」
	;生首 might be a little to literal here, often you'd just go beheaded or headless
	PRINTFORML 「For it is said that the world's most terrifying youkai with a freshly severed head still appears there from time to time.」
	PRINTFORML Sekibanki chuckles to herself, looking somehow very proud as she shares the locally circulated rumor...
	PRINTW 
ELSE
	PRINTFORML 「...What is it?」
	PRINTFORML Ignoring the dubious look on her face, you go ahead and introduce yourself.
	PRINTFORML Your unilateral initiative invites her to respond, which she does, albeit with obvious reluctance.
	;here comes the first pun
	PRINTFORMW 「Name's Sekibanki. It's a full name I'll have you know, so don't get any ideas about cutting it short or giving me any nicknames.」
	;Because that would be like be-heading the wrong road/neck as an alternative (kill me)
	PRINTFORML "It's no head for you to decapitate," she murmurs softly, her mouth widening into a grin as if she thought it was funny.
	PRINTFORML But when she notices that you're still standing there looking at her, she lets out a cough, as if to clear her throat and gloss over it.
	PRINTFORML 「A-Anyway... I'm looking forward to... not seeing you again.」
	PRINTFORML 「Because I don't have the slightest intention of asking for your continued patronage or anything like that.」
	PRINTFORML 「And the same should be said for you as well.」
	PRINTFORML 「Don't bother with this little me and don't force yourself to make small talk with me. You'll be doing us both a favor.」
	;another pun that talks about her head not being comfortable "sitting" on her neck or body pretty much; "you're in my shadow" kind of thing from seth in fallout
	PRINTFORMW 「I feel really out of it when someone's around, like I'm uncomfortable... or unlivable...」
	PRINTFORMW 「Basically, it makes me want to screw off my head and send it far away. In a figurative sense, of course.」
	PRINTFORMW （Even more so when I'm dealing with a guy, sheesh.）
ENDIF

RETURN 1

