	IF LOCAL:1 && ARG == 1
		IF RAND:2 == 0
			PRINTFORML 「You know I wouldn't have been too upset if you'd just ignored me.」
			PRINTFORML Sekibanki shoots you a glance as if spying on you.
		ELSE
			PRINTFORML 「Are you really so free to stop in the middle of your journey when you have nothing but your body and a lone head on your shoulders, human?」
